  lockedText: Maybe you missing something?.
  offerText: Last one ,A bit of meat, an egg, and some bacon... that doesn't sound
    like too much for you right now, does it?
  reminderText: So this is really the end, Just meat, egg and bacon basic things
    isn't it?
  exactText: Thank you so much for staying with me all the way to this point. Thank
    you for making it through life this far, for being right here. You're seriously,
    damn incredible.
